<title>USA: NYSE Unavailables - HRE Properties, Seagate Technology, Dallas Semiconductor.</title>
<headline>NYSE Unavailables - HRE Properties, Seagate Technology, Dallas Semiconductor.</headline>
<dateline>NEW YORK 1996-10-10</dateline>
<text>
<p>The New York Stock Exchange said HRE Properties, Seagate Technology Inc and Dallas Semiconductor Corp were not available for trade after hours for news.</p>
<p>After the market closed, HRE said that it has settled a dispute with a tenant for over $4 million.</p>
<p>Seagate reported earnings for its first quarter ended September 27 of $1.06 per fully diluted share, compared to $1.05 per share the previous first quarter.</p>
<p>Dallas Semiconductor reported third quarter earnings of $0.28 a share versus $0.34 a share and said that it sees improved margins in the fourth quarter.</p>
<p>The NYSE said that Paracelsus Healthcare Corp, Fruehauf Trailer Corp and Corimon SACA were also not available for after hours trade.</p>
</text>
